### Feature Promoter — GET ALL / GET ONE
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

# @name getAllPromoters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/promotores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# @name getOnePromoter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/promotores/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
